      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……看那样子，要当上她的训练员八成是件难事。\n前辈好像已经去换衣服了……怎么办？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddbfd5dc1ea556d580f2d5a5114af92c10fc36a6b6a40b6821e96b0761c7ad45",
